</head>
<body class="bg-soft">
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white border-bottom sticky-top shadow-sm">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand brand fw-bold" href="/" aria-label="Jacob Estate home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/jacobrent-mark.svg" alt="Jacob Estate mark">Jacob Estate</a>
            <div class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/properties"><i class="bi bi-buildings me-1"></i>Browse homes</a>
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="container legal-page py-5">
        <header class="mb-4">
            <span class="eyebrow text-uppercase">Jacob Estate</span>
            <h1 class="fw-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Last updated: November 15, 2026</p>
        </header>
        <article class="legal-document">
            <section>
                <h2>Using the service</h2>
                <p>Jacob Estate helps people discover <a href="/properties?type=rent">homes for rent</a> and <a href="/properties?type=sale">properties for sale</a>, and helps property owners publish listing information. By creating an account or using the service, you agree to these terms. You must provide accurate account information and keep your sign-in details secure. If you forget your password you can <a href="/forgot-password">reset it</a>.</p>
                <p>These terms work together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> and <a href="/data-protection">Data Protection and User Rights</a> page. You can read <a href="/about">About Us</a> for an overview of how the service works.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Accounts and listings</h2>
                <p>Use the service only for lawful property activity. Owners are responsible for having authority to list a property and for keeping its description, price, availability, and contact details accurate. Do not post misleading, unlawful, or unauthorized content. The <a href="/listing-guidelines">Property Listing Guidelines</a> explain what is expected, and we may reject, hide or remove listings and suspend accounts that break them. Users may submit one honest rating and comment for a property they have paid to rent.</p>
                <p>A verified label reflects the platform&#39;s listing review; it is not a guarantee of a property&#39;s condition, safety, ownership, title, or continued availability. Buyers and renters should independently confirm important details, inspect the property, and obtain appropriate professional advice before making a transaction. See <a href="/safety">Safety and Fraud Prevention</a> for practical steps.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Video tours</h2>
                <p>Every listing is presented with a video tour. Owners must only upload videos of the actual property that they have the right to use, in <a class="external-link" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MPEG-4_Part_14" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MP4<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>, <a class="external-link" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QuickTime_File_Format" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MOV<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> or <a class="external-link" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WebM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WebM<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> format and no larger than 50 MB. Videos are stored with our video hosting provider, <a class="external-link" href="https://cloudinary.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudinary<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Bookings and payments</h2>
                <p>Where <a class="external-link" href="https://paystack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paystack<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> checkout is offered, payment is processed through Paystack. The app records payment references, amounts, statuses, and dates to manage bookings; it does not store payment card details. For listings with a verified landlord payout account, Paystack routes 99% of the payment to that subaccount and 1% to the platform. Paystack transaction fees are assigned to the landlord&#39;s share. The <a href="/payment-policy">Payment and Payout Policy</a> explains this in more detail.</p>
                <p>A successful rental payment covers the monthly period shown in the booking flow. The booking page and payment provider show the amount before you pay. A renter may cancel an active booking in the app, but cancellation does not automatically issue a refund. Contact the property owner and payment provider about any separate refund or tenancy dispute, and read the <a href="/refund-policy">Refund and Cancellation Policy</a>. Jacob Estate does not process property purchase payments; sale inquiries connect buyers and sellers so they can discuss a transaction directly.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Your safety</h2>
                <p>You are responsible for taking reasonable care when renting or buying. Inspect a property before you pay, never pay outside the app for a booking made here, and never share your password or one-time codes. Our <a href="/safety">Safety and Fraud Prevention</a> page lists warning signs and explains where to report fraud, including the <a class="external-link" href="https://www.police.gov.ng/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nigeria Police Force<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Advertising and promotions</h2>
                <p>We do not currently show third-party advertising. Any promotion introduced in the future will be labelled, and paying for promotion will never make a listing verified. See the <a href="/advertising-disclosure">Advertising Disclosure</a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Privacy and cookies</h2>
                <p>How we collect and use your information is explained in the <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, and the small pieces of browser storage we use are listed in the <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
                <p>We work to keep the service available, but cannot promise uninterrupted access or that every listing will remain available. We may update features or these terms as the service changes. Continued use after updated terms are published means you accept the revised terms.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>For questions about these terms, visit the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>. Answers to common questions are in the <a href="/faq">frequently asked questions</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </article>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/legal-footer') %>
</body>
</html>